{#
  An escape route upward, from wherever the reader actually landed.

  Nineteen of thirty-one guidance pages had no inbound link from outside their own
  collection, so a reader arriving from a search engine had no way to discover that
  anything else existed (KI-WEB-SITE-019). A project guide has the same problem and a
  better answer: its way up is the project it belongs to, which is also the page that
  lists its siblings (KI-WEB-SITE-025).

  `project` is set by the directory data file beside the guides, so the link is
  derived from where the page lives rather than from a line each page repeats.
#}
{%- if project %}
<p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><a href="/projects/{{ project }}/">← {{ project }}</a></p>
{%- elif page.url.startsWith('/guidance/') and page.url != '/guidance/' %}
<p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><a href="/guidance/">← All guidance</a></p>
{%- endif %}
